1. fresh acquire: acquired
2. child sees live owner (the parent): busy
3. non-owner release refused
4. owner release ok
5. lock left by dead child: stole stale lock (owner was the dead child: 1)
6. child holds lock: busy (owner alive) (owner is the child: 1)
7. after the child released: acquired
8. empty lock file: stole corrupt lock
9. garbage lock file: stole corrupt lock
10. counter after 125 guarded increments: 125
11. no lock file left behind
